"Include menus when working out what parts of a pane are visible to avoid overwriting them".
In 3.8 a menu belongs to the window and pane output was not clipped against it, so an agent
redrawing its lines painted over an open menu until the next status redraw. The two files below
are that commit unchanged. Leave them out once the fleet moves to a tmux release that has it.
